  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－籃球",
    "sub_ename": "BASKETBALL",
    "describe_ch": "籃球運動，講究團隊合作，也重視個人能力表現，運球出神入化的A，將球交給擅長穿針引線的B，B再傳給神出鬼沒的C上籃或傳給百步穿揚的D。\r\n不論人多人少皆可達到運動效果，經濟實惠又可愉悅身心，更因興趣相投，結交好友不亦樂乎！\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "Basketball is a team sports designed to teach students the basic fundamentals of basketball: i.e., dribbling, pivoting, passing, shooting, faking, footwork, and defense. Some tactics strategy and team play are introduced.",
